## Linear Assignment Problems
- The setup of the most basic variant of linear assignment problems
  - There $n$ agents and $n$ tasks
  - We have a cost matrix $C$ where $C_{ij}$ is the cost of assigning agent $i$ to task $j$
  - Goal: assign each agent to a task while minimizing the total cost
  - Enforce 1-to-1 assignment

