## Future Directions
- All 3 methods here are deterministic
  - Single cell data has a lot of noise and is very large
  - Non-deterministic algorithms may be faster and more stable
- Some non-deterministic linear assignment algorithms include
  - Randomized auction algorithm
  - Simulated annealing
  - Genetic algorithms
- Still have to find a good objective function that is maximized when cells are correctly matched...
  



